  "extras": [],
  "faq": [
    {
      "question": "Your best chance to defeat an enemy hero with your gold card is when they have a low defense card in their discard; why is that?",
      "answer": "The simplest way to kill a hero is by getting a discard on them and waiting for turn 4 when they have no card to defend with. In Rowenna’s case, that doesn't work so well since she heals them first, but if that healed card's defense isn't high enough to block, you still can finish them off with her gold card. In other words, for Rowenna's gold to be effective, look for characters that have already played their high defense cards while having a low defense in the discard.",
      "source": "goa2-faq"
    },
    {
      "question": "Can my hero target themself with this ability?",
      "answer": "No. If your action is affecting you (your hero), it will say so in the card text. Otherwise, it will not affect you, even if it targets all units around you (“in radius”).",
      "source": "goa2-faq (common)"
    }
  ],
  "lore": "From a young age, Rowenna dreamed of becoming a knight. She trained relentlessly, honing her combat skills and mastering the code of chivalry. Whether facing monstrous beasts or overwhelming odds, Rowenna stands unwavering, ready to defend the innocent, support her comrades, and lead her troops to victory.",
